      "text": "Annuaire CIPRES : description p. 17, maquettes p. 52, glossaire p. 62 et p. 64",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
